{"4394110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asili Forest Gold", "steam_appid": 4394110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394110/extras/529faaef06faff688197eda2d9531f4d.avif?t=1776006596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>FROM THE FOREST TO THE STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asili Forest Gold</strong> is a third-person industrial adventure where nature meets high-tech automation. Start as a lone prospector in the lush Asili wilderness and evolve into an interstellar commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORE LOOP: EXTRACT &amp; AUTOMATE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Economy:</strong> Forget tedious menus. Once your backpack hits <strong>30 items</strong>, your gold is automatically sold and the currency is wired to your bank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Smart Shop:</strong> Stand in specialized zones to automatically purchase weapons, gear, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progress:</strong> Save your location and vehicle in 5 dedicated slots. Take risks, but play smart—death means losing your inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394110/extras/2?t=1776006596\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STAR OF THE SHOW: YOUR DRONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't mine alone. Your <strong>Autonomous Mining Drone</strong> handles the heavy lifting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command AI:</strong> Set it to <strong>Follow, Sleep, or Mine.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autonomous Work:</strong> Deploy your drone at a gold vein and leave it behind; it stays on-site until the job is done or you recall it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Extraction:</strong> High-powered laser tech ensures maximum efficiency.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, BUILD, &amp; SURVIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Locomotion:</strong> Navigate the forest on foot or via a customizable car with a multi-camera navigation system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building:</strong> Buy houses and furniture from the Market UI. Drag, drop, and rotate items like sofas and beds to create your sanctuary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Use your <strong>Proximity Scanner</strong> and <strong>Torch</strong> to find hidden items in dark caves or dive into lakes for underwater riches.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HYPER-DRIVE SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is only the beginning. Complete your missions to recover the <strong>Hyper-Drive</strong> and board the ship waiting for you at the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile Worlds:</strong> Travel to new planets where the air is unbreathable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remote Command:</strong> Pilot your ship and deploy drones from the cockpit to harvest minerals on deadly surfaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Horizons:</strong> Every 2-3 months game will be updated to brings new levels and planets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYSTEM FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat:</strong> Defend yourself with grenades against hostile drones in &quot;No-Go&quot; zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle:</strong> Realistic lighting that affects your mining strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Full control over your character, backpack, and weapon skins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394110/extras/529faaef06faff688197eda2d9531f4d.avif?t=1776006596\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>FROM THE FOREST TO THE STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asili Forest Gold</strong> is a third-person industrial adventure where nature meets high-tech automation. Start as a lone prospector in the lush Asili wilderness and evolve into an interstellar commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORE LOOP: EXTRACT &amp; AUTOMATE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Economy:</strong> Forget tedious menus. Once your backpack hits <strong>30 items</strong>, your gold is automatically sold and the currency is wired to your bank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Smart Shop:</strong> Stand in specialized zones to automatically purchase weapons, gear, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progress:</strong> Save your location and vehicle in 5 dedicated slots. Take risks, but play smart—death means losing your inventory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394110/extras/2?t=1776006596\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STAR OF THE SHOW: YOUR DRONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't mine alone. Your <strong>Autonomous Mining Drone</strong> handles the heavy lifting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command AI:</strong> Set it to <strong>Follow, Sleep, or Mine.</s